      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd agree that this is quite a problem for worlds with a lot of Heat in the algorithm. I'd be glad to see a cool-off happen for these worlds, unless it's in Community Labs.\nI also see creators abusing the \"avatars\" tag even though there isn't a pedestal in sight. I kinda wish that would be prevented.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
