      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed today that there seems to be also a way to push existing worlds into the \"New\" and \"New & Noteworthy\" section as well. Example is this world:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7281543e-6888-4676-896a-fdd090552fc4\n\nMy only guess is that it is possible to delete a world and reupload the world with the same ID again, since even the Published date is changed, but Favorites are not affected.\n\nThis hurts new Worlds visibility even more.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-23T10:54:26.973Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I keep seeing world creators literally just spamming every hour a \"change\" on their map from the website by reducing the player limit by one and reverting it or just adding a . to the bio. I think it's super frustrating for new creators or people who are legitimatly updating their maps.\nEveryone wants good numbers on their map I get it but spamming these fake updates to inflate your number is just kinda annoying and an obvious obsession trying to keep a map alive without actually updating or putting in any effort, lets stop the clutter of maps just trying to hog the tab :/.",
